---
description: Label Mac vs Cursor workspace when giving paths, env, or terminal steps
alwaysApply: true
---

# Context: Mac vs Cursor workspace

When answering about files, terminals, env vars, or commands:

- Say explicitly whether the step applies **on your Mac** (any terminal: Cursor terminal, Terminal.app, iTerm — same machine) vs **only inside the Cursor workspace** (e.g. a path under the opened repo root, or something the agent can only do via Cursor tools).
- If the relevant path is the **opened project folder** (workspace root), call that **“in this Cursor workspace”** (or give the absolute workspace path).
- If the user is in **`~` (home)** or another folder **outside** the repo, say **“on your Mac, outside the project folder”** so `npm run` / paths are not confused with the workspace.
